    "summary": "[SOC2-CC6.1][HIGH] Contrôle d'accès logique insuffisant — Absence de MFA sur comptes admin AWS",
    "description": {
      "version": 1,
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": { "level": 2 },
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Big Four Audit Finding — FIND-2026-002" }]
        },
        {
          "type": "panel",
          "attrs": { "panelType": "error" },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "attrs": { "level": 3 },
              "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "🔍 Root Cause Analysis (ISA 265)" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "La politique IAM AWS n'impose pas le MFA (Multi-Factor Authentication) pour les comptes administrateurs. 3 comptes admin sur 12 n'ont pas MFA activé. Le déploiement initial de la politique IAM a été fait sans revue de sécurité Big Four." }]
        },
        {
          "type": "panel",
          "attrs": { "panelType": "warning" },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "attrs": { "level": 3 },
              "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "💰 Impact Financier & Réglementaire" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Impact estimé: 45 000 000 FCFA. Niveau de risque SOC 2: Élevé — CC6.1 non conforme. Module: AWS IAM Security. Détecteur: KOS Security Scan Edge Function v3." }]
        },
        {
          "type": "panel",
          "attrs": { "panelType": "success" },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "attrs": { "level": 3 },
              "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "✅ Plan d'Action Correctif" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": { "level": 4 },
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "1. Action Immédiate (< 72h)" }]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Activer MFA sur les 3 comptes admin non protégés via AWS IAM Console. Désactiver temporairement les comptes sans MFA jusqu'à activation." }]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": { "level": 4 },
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "2. Action Long Terme" }]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Déployer une SCP (Service Control Policy) AWS Organizations bloquant toute action admin sans MFA. Audit trimestriel IAM automatisé via AWS Config Rule iam-user-mfa-enabled." }]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": { "level": 4 },
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "3. Test d'Audit (ISAE 3000)" }]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "aws iam list-users | grep MFA — Vérifier que 100% des comptes admin ont MFA=True. Tester l'accès console sans MFA (doit être bloqué)." }]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "📎 Evidence (ISA 265): https://confluence.khepraexperts.com/display/SEC/IAM-MFA-Audit-2026-07" }]
        }
      ]
    },
